      "id": "style",
      "label": "Look and sound",
      "type": "markdown",
      "required": false,
      "value": "Look: a designed still life, flat like a well-made product film: each object drawn in two or three flat tones of its own (a lit face, a side, a darker edge) in a gentle three-quarter view; solid shapes with no outlines, textures, glow, gradients or grain; a flat shadow shape under each object where it rests; no camera shake. Drawn on every frame, not on twos: the springs' small overshoots must read.\nColours or brand colours: ivory #f8fafc ground; ink #05070c and two or three greys between ink and ivory for the objects' faces and the surfaces they rest on; AwwO blue #2f7df6 as the one accent: one detail per scene, and the mark.\nType: Space Grotesk for the words, large (about 11 % of the frame's height); Inter for the labels, legible on a phone (cap height at least 3.7 % of the frame's height).\nMusic (style, tempo): calm and precise, 80 BPM, one bar per scene: a soft pulse (a muted kick and a pluck) over a pad, a soft hit on the frame where each object comes to rest, and one held chord under the mark that fades out by the last frame."
